    "detailed_description": "Mercenaries Saga 1 is a turn based tactical simulation RPG.<br>It is the first of the series followed by many other solid simulation games: Mercenaries Blaze and Mercenaries Rebirth being the most recent addition to the series.<br><br><br>[Game Characteristics]<br>\u30fbQuarter view battlefield in dot-art \u2013 Command your characters and lead them to victory!<br><br>\u30fbAttacking from the side, back or higher ground deals more damage \u2013 Take advantage of the 3D terrain when building your strategy.<br> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2142230/extras/b72aea932bfa1919c4e4fdd840c2eef7.poster.avif?t=1727198673\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2142230/extras/b72aea932bfa1919c4e4fdd840c2eef7.webm?t=1727198673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2142230/extras/b72aea932bfa1919c4e4fdd840c2eef7.mp4?t=1727198673\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br>\u30fbClass change system using SP \u2013 As your characters level up they are able to choose Advanced and Expert level classes which allow new skill sets to be learned. Some items unlock Special classes. Create a balanced team to your liking!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2142230/extras/a4aa4f846d7c43f3583930318d19f018.poster.avif?t=1727198673\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2142230/extras/a4aa4f846d7c43f3583930318d19f018.webm?t=1727198673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2142230/extras/a4aa4f846d7c43f3583930318d19f018.mp4?t=1727198673\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>\u30fbLearn new skills using SP \u2013 Take advantage of the various skills which can buff, debuff or cast status ailments upon enemies.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2142230/extras/b63a7f1a9d3d9eb48358cc4f80fc0c01.poster.avif?t=1727198673\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2142230/extras/b63a7f1a9d3d9eb48358cc4f80fc0c01.webm?t=1727198673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2142230/extras/b63a7f1a9d3d9eb48358cc4f80fc0c01.mp4?t=1727198673\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2142230/extras/eaff9dc69ed28bc1a4aa94ed9312bbbb.poster.avif?t=1727198673\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2142230/extras/eaff9dc69ed28bc1a4aa94ed9312bbbb.webm?t=1727198673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2142230/extras/eaff9dc69ed28bc1a4aa94ed9312bbbb.mp4?t=1727198673\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br>\u30fbMulti-ending storyline \u2013 Your choices affect each character\u2019s destiny.<br><br>\u30fbEx stages \u2013 Extra challenging stages for the highly skilled player. <br><br><br><br>[Story]<br>Fornea, the Green Continent is known for its vast expanses and warm climate.<br>Stretching from the south to west is the Flare Kingdom, who has been conquering its neighboring countries in the recent years. <br><br>In the southern tip lies the Kingdom of Mondoa. Fearing the growing power of Flare, Mondoa invades Sekrak, a smaller country to its north in attempt to obtain more territory. <br><br>Mondoa is met with fierce resistance. As the war drags on, this situation brings great joy to mercenaries who fight for coin. Many large mercenary companies use the opportunity to line their pockets with gold.<br><br>However, things are different for those without an established name. <br><br>Our story differs in many ways, focusing on the young commander Leon and his troop of but six fresh-faced mercenaries: The White Lions\u2026",
